## 14. Simple Calculator

```python
a = float(input("Enter first number: "))
operator = input("Enter operator (+, -, *, /): ")
b = float(input("Enter second number: "))

if operator == "+":
    print("Result =", a + b)
elif operator == "-":
    print("Result =", a - b)
elif operator == "*":
    print("Result =", a * b)
elif operator == "/":
    if b != 0:
        print("Result =", a / b)
    else:
        print("Division by zero is not allowed")
else:
    print("Invalid Operator")
```

